 function markup(name){return `<section class="page companion-page" id="companion-page"><div class="companion-heading"><span class="companion-eyebrow">A LITTLE COMPANY</span><h1>一起，慢慢来。</h1><p>${escape(name)} 在这里，陪你专注，也陪你放空。</p></div><div class="pet-stage" id="pet-stage" aria-label="小鲸互动区域"><div class="pet-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="pet-feedback" id="pet-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite">轻轻碰它一下。</p><button class="pet" id="pet" aria-label="摸摸小鲸，也可以拖动"><span class="pet-facing"><span class="pet-body">${whaleSVG}</span></span></button><span class="pet-stage-caption">轻触 · 拖动 · 让它自由游动</span></div><div class="pet-tools"><button class="pill" id="pet-roam" aria-pressed="true">自由游动</button><label class="pet-size-label">大小<input id="pet-size" aria-label="小鲸大小" type="range" min="80" max="176" value="128"></label></div><section class="focus-card"><div class="focus-copy"><span class="companion-eyebrow">一起专注一会儿</span><h2 id="focus-title">给眼前的事一点时间。</h2><p id="focus-status" role="status">开始后，小鲸会出现在锁屏和灵动岛。</p></div><div class="focus-durations" aria-label="陪伴时长">${[5,25,50].map(n=>`<button data-duration="${n}" aria-pressed="${n===25}">${n}<small>分钟</small></button>`).join('')}</div><button class="primary focus-action" id="focus-start">开始陪伴</button><button class="secondary focus-action" id="focus-stop" hidden>结束本次陪伴</button><p class="focus-clock" id="focus-clock" aria-label="本次陪伴剩余时间"></p></section><button class="companion-chat secondary" id="companion-chat">和小鲸聊聊 ↗</button><details class="companion-help"><summary>把小鲸放到主屏幕</summary><p>长按 iPhone 主屏幕空白处 → 编辑 → 添加小组件 → 搜索 Fishbot → 选择「小鲸陪伴」。安装更新后若未出现，请先打开一次 App。</p><p>主屏幕小鲸按系统节奏刷新，不会连续游动。锁屏和灵动岛展示的是你主动开始的限时专注活动；不支持灵动岛的设备会显示在锁屏。结束时间到后会显示活动已结束，回到 App 会清理活动。</p><p>App 不会跨应用悬浮、读取其他 App，或在后台持续调用聊天 API。小组件只显示预设问候，不展示聊天和记忆。</p></details></section>`;}
